{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01175","headline":"相和歌辞 从军行 · 厉玄","name":"相和歌辞 从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"边草早不春，劒花增泞尘。\n广场收骥尾，清瀚怯龙鳞。\n帆色已归越，松声厌避秦。\n几时逢范蠡，处处是通津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"厉玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}